  ⟨@Full.SK09.lemmaNN, @Full.SK09.commutatorFT, @Full.SK09.powerDifferences,
    @Full.SK09.wordAtLevelZero, @Full.SK09.ultraproductLEF⟩

/-- **`lem:host`** (tex l.527–537): for an infinite finitely generated LEF group `Δ`, the lamplighter
