that of `Γ`; (b) the word problem of `G_Δ` is Turing reducible to that of `Δ`.

Conjuncts: `SK11.halflineA`, `SK11.halflineA_solvable`, `SK11.halflineB`,
`SK11.halflineB_solvable`, and the closed `SK11.lamplighterHostSolvableWP`. -/
