    @Full.SK13.wp_solvable_iff_recursive, @Full.SK13.fibonacci_wp_solvable, @Full.SK13.every_degree,
    @Full.SK13.continuum_antichain⟩

/-- **The proof of `cor:wp`** (tex l.692–726), sentence by sentence: multiplying out a word
